  "questions": [
    {
      "dom_id": "question-359057",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find the greatest common factor of the terms $25z$ and $10z.$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the GCF, we list the factors of the coefficients and identify any common variable factors in the expressions.\n\nThe factors of $25$ are\n\n$$\n1,\\,5,\\,25.\n$$\n\nThe factors of $10$ are\n\n$$\n1,\\,2,\\,5,\\,10.\n$$\n\nThe common factors of $25$ and $10$ are\n\n$$\n1,\\,5.\n$$\n\nThe greatest of these common factors is $5.$\n\nNow we look at the variable factors. Both $25z$ and $10z$ contain $z.$\n\nThus, the greatest common factor of $25z$ and $10z$ is $5z.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-359057\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/85#817\">Finding the Greatest Common Factor of Two Variable Expressions</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"359057\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Find the greatest common factor of the terms <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 6:34 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:41</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
