    {
      "dom_id": "question-186161",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Evaluate the following:\n\n$\\sqrt[3]{-1,000}=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "First, notice that the number $-1,000$ is a perfect cube.\n\nSo, to determine the value of $\\sqrt[3]{-1,000},$ we express $-1,000$ as a perfect cube:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{-1,000} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(-10)\\cdot (-10)\\cdot (-10)} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(-10)^{3}} & = \\\\ -10 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
