      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-53034\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">9.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1459#2834\">Identifying a Quadrilateral</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"53034\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-53034\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the figures above is a square?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 6:34 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:00</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
