    {
      "dom_id": "question-160571",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "What is the distance between the points $(-3,-2)$  and $(-3,-7)?$",
      "worked_solution": "**Method 1** \n\nWe plot the given points in the coordinate plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14220930/assets/fa516432771fd242ed51ba8548dd04ca88991fc14992be811a53f8e124b9ff7d.png)\n\nThe distance between two points is the length of the line segment that connects them.\n\nFrom the diagram, we see that the length of the segment is $5$ units, so the distance equals $5.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14220930/assets/999cdc70474e5b928b28d611d4c66fb3eeea5716f516af41574712337cb6f9e9.png)\n\n**Method 2**\n\nWe can find the distance between the two points by finding the distance of each point from the $x$-axis and then subtracting.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14220930/assets/91bd9f4cd88e966b796f97184eee8aa791e2f20301ff700906ded4d4731eaaf7.png)\n\nThe point $(-3,-7)$ is at a distance of $7$ from the $x$-axis, and the point $(-3,-2)$ is at a distance of $2$ from the $x$-axis. Therefore, the distance between the two points is $7-2=5.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-160571\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">11.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/573#2648\">Finding the Vertical Distance Between Two Points</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"160571\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>What is the distance between the points <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"83\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c