    {
      "dom_id": "question-162123",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "What is the missing part of the expression below?\n\n$$\n-\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{\\bbox[1pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}}{2}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "A negative number can be obtained if we divide two numbers, one of which is positive and the other negative.\n\nSo, given a negative fraction, we have the following equivalent notations:\n\n$$\n-\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{-9}{2}=\\frac{9}{-2}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we see that the denominator on the right-hand side is positive $(2).$ Therefore, the missing numerator must be $(-9):$\n\n$$\n-\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{-9}{2}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-162123\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/4136#12361\">Identifying Equivalent Fractions With Negative Numbers</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"162123\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>What is the missing part of the expression below?\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: 1pt solid black;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.95em; margin: 0.1em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.1em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.95em;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mphantom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mphantom></mjx-texatom></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></