</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 6:34 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:00</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
